docs/VALIDATION.md-176- - If no built-in browser automation tool is in your current toolset, script the environment's installed Playwright library. Before launching, check which browser builds exist (`ls ~/.cache/ms-playwright`) and prefer launching with an installed build or the system browser executable (e.g. `/usr/bin/chromium` via `executablePath`); do not download browsers.
